   "widgets_values": [
    "A cinematic ultrawide film still: a vast, empty old-world street at golden hour, a two-shot framing both characters together, both whole bodies in view with plenty of space around them.\nStyle: moody cinematic film still, anamorphic look, subtle film grain, realistic photograph.\nLighting: warm low-angle golden-hour sunlight raking across the street, long shadows, soft rim light on both of their hair and shoulders.\nFraming: extreme wide shot, 21:9 ultrawide, eye-level camera, shallow depth of field on the background, both figures clearly separated and fully visible.\nMedium: 35mm anamorphic film.\nPalette: warm amber and teal shadows, dusty gold highlights.\nBackground: a long empty old-world street with weathered buildings receding into soft haze, gentle atmospheric depth.\nBoth standing still, looking toward the camera with calm expressions, a relaxed friendship between them.\nEXACTLY two men total in the entire frame: one on the left in a white t-shirt, one on the right in a black t-shirt. Each man stands alone in his own area. No other people anywhere. NOT three men. No duplicates, no twins, no extra man.",
    2712,
    1160,
    "[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"zidhan (left)\",\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"lora\": \"krea2zidhan_v2.safetensors\",\n    \"trigger\": \"dlor\",\n    \"prompt\": \"a young man in his mid-twenties with short neat black hair, a full short dense black beard, dark brown eyes, lean slim build, wearing a plain white t-shirt and dark trousers, standing ALONE on the left side of the street, only ONE man in this area, no second man beside him, no duplicate of him\",\n    \"strength\": 1.0,\n    \"x\": 0.08,\n    \"y\": 0.08,\n    \"w\": 0.3,\n    \"h\": 0.84,\n    \"start\": 0.0,\n    \"end\": 1.0\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"jaisal (right)\",\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"lora\": \"krea2jaisal_v2.safetensors\",\n    \"trigger\": \"jeskv\",\n    \"prompt\": \"a young man in his mid-twenties with medium wavy black hair falling to eyebrow length, slightly crooked naturally bent nose, dark brown almond eyes, thin lips, clean-shaven with faint stubble, lean slim build, wearing a plain black t-shirt, standing ALONE on the right side of the street, only ONE man in this area, no second man beside him, no duplicate of him\",\n    \"strength\": 1.0,\n    \"x\": 0.62,\n    \"y\": 0.08,\n    \"w\": 0.3,\n    \"h\": 0.84,\n    \"start\": 0.0,\n    \"end\": 1.0\n  }\n]",
